.TH SDL_AsyncIOQueue 3type "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 DATATYPES"
.SH NAME
SDL_AsyncIOQueue \- A queue of completed asynchronous I/O tasks.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_asyncio.h>
.PP
.BI "typedef struct SDL_AsyncIOQueue SDL_AsyncIOQueue;
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
When starting an asynchronous operation, you specify a queue for the new task\[char46] A queue can be asked later if any tasks in it have completed, allowing an app to manage multiple pending tasks in one place, in whatever order they complete\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This struct is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDL_CreateAsyncIOQueue (3),
.BR SDL_ReadAsyncIO (3),
.BR SDL_WriteAsyncIO (3),
.BR SDL_GetAsyncIOResult (3),
.BR SDL_WaitAsyncIOResult (3)
